{
  "about": "The shapes a driver's source and evidence must have. source_ok: chant-fly and arugula-release deploy a commit by its full 40 lowercase hex (never a branch, a tag or a short id the box resolves), planter's as deploy/planter says, any other driver anything. fly_image_ok: one of Fly's registry's images for the app, by digest (registry.fly.io/<app>[:<tag>]@sha256:<64 hex>). ledger_link_ok: a line of chant's ledger in the repository on GitHub, at a commit. roll_back_ok: the deploy's id (dep_ and 32 hex), each value one printable word starting with a letter or digit, and for chant-fly exactly image, chant_component, chant_env and chant_digest, the image the app's and chant_env the settings'; for any other driver nothing more.",
